[SIZE=5][COLOR=#FF6600][B]🎃 Halloween Plugin v3.0.9 + v3.1.0 - World Blacklist & Message Expansion![/B][/COLOR][/SIZE]

[COLOR=#FF6600][B]Release Date:[/B][/COLOR] October 21, 2025
[COLOR=#FF6600][B]Type:[/B][/COLOR] Feature release - world filtering + message customization

[SIZE=4][COLOR=#CC3300]✨ New Features[/COLOR][/SIZE]

[COLOR=#009900][B]v3.1.0 - World Blacklist System[/B][/COLOR]
[LIST]
[*][B]NEW:[/B] Disable Halloween events in specific worlds (nether, creative, admin worlds)
[*][B]COMPLETE:[/B] All 12 event types respect world blacklist (bosses, traders, graves, scares)
[*][B]SMART MERGE:[/B] Automatically adds worlds_blacklist section when upgrading from v3.0.x
[*][B]FLEXIBLE:[/B] Supports vanilla (nether, the_end) and custom world names (world_nether, world_the_end)
[*][B]NO DATA LOSS:[/B] Your custom config settings are preserved during upgrade
[/LIST]

[COLOR=#009900][B]v3.0.9 - Additional Message Customization[/B][/COLOR]
[LIST]
[*][B]EXPANDED:[/B] 9 more messages moved to messages.yml (XP rewards, cooldowns, pumpkin love notes)
[*][B]VARIATIONS:[/B] 19 total message variations for better variety
[*][B]TRANSLATABLE:[/B] All player-facing messages now in one file
[/LIST]

[SIZE=4][COLOR=#0066CC]📋 World Blacklist Configuration[/COLOR][/SIZE]

[CODE]
# In config.yml (auto-added when upgrading)
worlds_blacklist:
  - nether           # Vanilla nether
  - world_nether     # Multiverse/custom servers
  - the_end          # Vanilla the_end
  - world_the_end    # Multiverse/custom servers
  - creative_world   # Add any world name you want
[/CODE]

[B]What gets disabled in blacklisted worlds:[/B]
[LIST]
[*]Login pumpkin spawns
[*]Pumpkin trader creation (villagers)
[*]Boss spawning (zombie/skeleton bosses)
[*]Grave encounters
[*]All scare events (pumpkin curse, slenderman, fire, lightning, darkness, herobrine)
[*]Bat witch transformations
[/LIST]

[SIZE=4][COLOR=#FF6600]⚙️ Installation[/COLOR][/SIZE]

[B]From v3.0.8 → v3.1.0:[/B]
[LIST=1]
[*]Stop your server
[*]Replace [FONT=courier]halloween-plugin-3.0.8.jar[/FONT] with [FONT=courier]halloween-plugin-3.1.0.jar[/FONT]
[*]Start your server
[*][B]worlds_blacklist[/B] section auto-added to config.yml (at bottom of file)
[*][B]messages.yml[/B] smart-merged with 9 new message types
[*]All your existing settings preserved!
[/LIST]

[B]From older versions (v3.0.0-v3.0.7):[/B]
Same process! Smart merge handles everything automatically.

[SIZE=4][COLOR=#9900CC]💡 Use Cases[/COLOR][/SIZE]

[LIST]
[*][B]Creative worlds:[/B] Disable Halloween in build/creative worlds
[*][B]Nether/End:[/B] No Halloween chaos in dangerous dimensions
[*][B]Admin worlds:[/B] Staff areas remain event-free
[*][B]Minigame worlds:[/B] Prevent Halloween interference
[*][B]Multiverse servers:[/B] Full control over which worlds get Halloween events
[/LIST]

[COLOR=#CC6600][B]Compatibility:[/B][/COLOR] v3.0.x → v3.1.0 = Automatic migration (zero manual edits needed)
[COLOR=#CC6600][B]Minecraft:[/B][/COLOR] 1.21.1+ (Paper/Purpur recommended)
[COLOR=#CC6600][B]Java:[/B][/COLOR] 17+

[SIZE=4][COLOR=#00AA00]✅ What's Fixed[/COLOR][/SIZE]

[LIST]
[*]World blacklist now correctly handles YAML quoted strings
[*]Smart config merge adds new sections to END of file (clean organization)
[*]Config upgrade from v3.0.x preserves ALL admin customizations
[/LIST]

